  "body": "## sqly v1.7.5\n\nRun SQL over CSV, TSV, LTSV, JSON, JSONL, Parquet, Excel, ACH, Fedwire, and\nsupported compressed inputs (.gz, .bz2, .xz, .zst, .z, .snappy, .s2, .lz4).\n\nInstall or upgrade, then see the grouped highlights below. Every artifact is\nsigned and ships with an SBOM and build provenance — see\n[Verify a release](https://nao1215.github.io/sqly/install/#verify-a-release).\n\n## Changelog\n### Bug fixes\n* 97ef292c628b7a642a949bcfd7457cabdcb4f4a9: fix(output): write TSV without quoting so saved values read back unchanged (@nao1215)\n### Others\n* e3440740b1f85e27651b224ba8bbc1dfaa5e136d: build(go): require Go 1.26.11 to pick up the net/http fix for GO-2026-6859 (@nao1215)\n\n**Full changelog**: https://github.com/nao1215/sqly/compare/v1.7.4...v1.7.5\n\n",
